WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640
What's going on?

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:28,470
Is it the obsession to move forward even if you lose it? She is dead.

3
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:30,110
Let me give you this bag of supplies

4
00:00:30,110 --> 00:00:34,410
I hope this lie will make her less painful

5
00:00:34,410 --> 00:00:37,090
Anyway, we don’t lack this pack of supplies for our drama.

6
00:00:37,090 --> 00:00:38,490
This house is already dirty

7
00:00:38,490 --> 00:00:40,010
I can help you find another house

8
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:41,410
The rest is up to you
